0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Problem statement\r\n\r\nThe `Responses:` of a `swagger:route` should have support to add a description (which is required by the Swagger specification).\r\n\r\nHaving a comment on the response type adds a description in the `definitions` but not on the `responses`.\r\n\r\n## Swagger specification\r\n\r\nSee http://swagger.io/specification/#responseObject\r\n\r\n## Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\n1. Declare a `swagger:route` with `Responses:`\r\n2. No description can be set (just a named response)\r\n3. The `description` property is missing on the `responses` object in the generated JSON","closed_by":{"login":"GlenDC","id":3900482,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDA0ODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3900482?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GlenDC","html_url":"https://github.com/GlenDC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GlenDC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GlenDC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GlenDC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GlenDC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GlenDC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GlenDC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GlenDC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GlenDC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GlenDC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-swagger/go-swagger/issues/738/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-swagger/go-swagger/issues/738/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}